# Quote is a lasting event: the queue conflates the updates of a symbol instead of buffering them, and drops none.
# How many of the 1000 updates arrive depends on timing, so the checks are invariants: the last value wins, the
# values that arrive keep their order, and nothing is counted as dropped.
scenario kit-conflation-quote
requires capability publisher

send endpoint e local_hub
send queue q e Quote
send subscribe q kit-conflation-quote.A kit-conflation-quote.END
send publish-burst e Quote kit-conflation-quote.A 1000
send publish e Quote event_symbol=kit-conflation-quote.END bid_price=1
expect poll q 1000 -> until kit-conflation-quote.END
  last kit-conflation-quote.A bid_price=1000
  count kit-conflation-quote.A >= 1
  count kit-conflation-quote.A <= 1000
  increasing kit-conflation-quote.A bid_price
  dropped = 0
  monotonic dropped
end
